# While editing in the outline pane, starring and flagging the block through the command menu lists it in a Starred view in the other pane at once.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
	- Renew passport
END
keys <C-w> s gS g1 j <Enter>
type  now
keys /
type star
keys <Enter>
see - Call the plumber now 󰓎  INBOX
status EDIT
type !
keys /
type flag
keys <Enter>
see - Call the plumber now! 󰈻 󰓎  INBOX
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber now! @star @flag
	- Renew passport
END
